# Victor Vallakovich travelling with the party (docs/voice/victor_vallakovich.md): short lines a guest says while walking with the party, shown and voiced
# like banter (story/banter.gd). The node's name says when it may play: quest_ on entering an area while their story is
# at that point (these come first), place_ on entering an area, fight_ after a won fight, idle_ now and then on the
# road. Each plays once per playthrough, only while Victor is with the party. Every line here is unvoiced for now.

~ quest_maids
if guest:victor_vallakovich and quest.victors_circle >= persuaded
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: Grigor and Mirela. Those were their names. I'm telling you so somebody else knows them.
endif
-> END

~ place_mansion
if guest:victor_vallakovich and at:vallaki_burgomaster_mansion
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: Don't go up to the attic. I mean it. Not even to look. Especially not to look.
endif
-> END

~ place_vallaki
if guest:victor_vallakovich and region:vallaki
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: Home. Father's arranged another festival, so the whole town can be miserable in matching hats.
endif
-> END

~ place_castle
if guest:victor_vallakovich and region:castle_ravenloft
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: He has a library. A real one. I'm going to hate how much I want to see it.
endif
-> END

~ place_amber
if guest:victor_vallakovich and region:amber_temple
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: Wizards came here to buy power. You can tell. The whole place smells like an argument somebody lost.
endif
-> END

~ fight_nearly
if guest:victor_vallakovich
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: It's nearly right. My casting. It's nearly right. Stop looking at me.
endif
-> END

~ fight_count
if guest:victor_vallakovich
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: I can count. Everyone's here. Good. I always count.
endif
-> END

~ fight_table
if guest:victor_vallakovich
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: Father would have hidden under the table. I'm only telling you so you know I'm not him.
endif
-> END

~ idle_out
if guest:victor_vallakovich
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: Out. That's all I wanted. Out of the house, out of the valley. Now I'm out, and it's mostly mud.
endif
-> END

~ idle_practising
if guest:victor_vallakovich
interject guest:victor_vallakovich: If you see Mother, tell her I'm practising. She likes it when I'm practising.
endif
-> END
